   "created_at": "2026-09-29T16:56:36.063Z",
   "visibility": "public",
   "language": "en",
   "spoiler_text": "",
   "content": "<p>Bitwise rolled out the Bitwise NEAR ETF (NRR) on NYSE Arca today, marketing the fund as AI infrastructure while baking in-house staking yields straight into the NAV.</p><p>Packaging a proof-of-stake blockchain inside an exchange wrapper with a 0.75% management fee shows asset managers will brand almost any decentralized network as AI-ready to collect fees on.</p><p><a href=\"https://mastodon.social/tags/NearProtocol\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>NearProtocol</span></a> <a href=\"https://mastodon.social/tags/CryptoETF\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>CryptoETF</span></a></p><p><a href=\"https://zubiqo.com/news/bitwise-launches-first-spot-near-etf-targets-ai-agent-economy-narrative-lngdjl\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" translate=\"no\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://</span><span class=\"ellipsis\">zubiqo.com/news/bitwise-launch</span><span class=\"invisible\">es-first-spot-near-etf-targets-ai-agent-economy-narrative-lngdjl</span></a></p>",
